{"unit_id": "tag:01T9:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由此可知，拓扑学（Topology）一章第<REF_0001>节中的大部分内容仍然成立，只需将闭点（closed points）的集合（set）换成由有限型（finite type）点组成的集合（set）。事实上，若<MATH_0001>是雅各布森（Jacobson）的，则闭点（closed points）恰好就是有限型点（finite type points）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "被引用的篇章标题。"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "原集合由闭点组成。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指闭点所成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "修饰替换后集合中的点。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指有限型点所成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "第二句中保证两类点一致的条件。"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "在所述条件下与有限型点一致。"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "在所述条件下与闭点一致。"}], "notes": []}
